# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Hadamard test {#hadamard-test}"
msgstr "Hadamard-Test {#hadamard-test}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![fig2.png](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-subspace-"
"diagonalization/c5263851-6067-4ca2-8e0c-a835631cdc7f.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![fig2.png](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-subspace-"
"diagonalization/c5263851-6067-4ca2-8e0c-a835631cdc7f.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    |0\\rangle|0\\rangle^N \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle + |1\\rangle \\Big)|0\\rangle^N \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle|0\\rangle^N+|1\\rangle |\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle |0\\rangle^N+|1\\rangle P |\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle |\\psi_j\\rangle+|1\\rangle P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big)\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    |0\\rangle|0\\rangle^N \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle + |1\\rangle \\Big)|0\\rangle^N \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle|0\\rangle^N+|1\\rangle |\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle |0\\rangle^N+|1\\rangle P |\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) \\quad\\longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\Big(|0\\rangle |\\psi_j\\rangle+|1\\rangle P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big)\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Where $P$ is one of the terms in the decomposition of the Hamiltonian "
"$H=\\sum P$ and $\\text{Prep} \\; \\psi_i$, $\\text{Prep} \\; \\psi_j$ are "
"controlled operations that prepare $|\\psi_i\\rangle$, $|\\psi_j\\rangle$ "
"vectors of the unitary Krylov space, with $|\\psi_k\\rangle = e^{-i H k dt }"
" \\vert \\psi \\rangle = e^{-i H k dt } U_{\\psi} \\vert 0 \\rangle^N$. To "
"measure $X$, first apply $H$...\n"
msgstr ""
"Dabei ist $P$ einer der Terme in der Zerlegung des Hamiltonoperators "
"$H=\\sum P$ und $\\text{Prep} \\; \\psi_i$, $\\text{Prep} \\; \\psi_j$ sind "
"kontrollierte Operationen, die die $|\\psi_i\\rangle$-, "
"$|\\psi_j\\rangle$-Vektoren des unitären Krylov-Raums vorbereiten, wobei "
"$|\\psi_k\\rangle = e^{-i H k dt } \\vert \\psi \\rangle = e^{-i H k dt } "
"U_{\\psi} \\vert 0 \\rangle^N$. Um $X$ zu messen, wende zunächst $H$ an...\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    \\longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{1}{2}|0\\rangle\\Big( |\\psi_j\\rangle + P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) + \\frac{1}{2}|1\\rangle\\Big(|\\psi_j\\rangle - P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big)\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    \\longrightarrow\\quad\\frac{1}{2}|0\\rangle\\Big( |\\psi_j\\rangle + P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big) + \\frac{1}{2}|1\\rangle\\Big(|\\psi_j\\rangle - P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big)\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "... then measure:\n"
msgstr "... dann messen:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\begin{split}\n"
"    \\Rightarrow\\quad\\langle X\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{4}\\Bigg(\\Big\\|| \\psi_j\\rangle + P|\\psi_i\\rangle \\Big\\|^2-\\Big\\||\\psi_j\\rangle - P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big\\|^2\\Bigg) \\\\\n"
"    &= \\text{Re}\\Big[\\langle\\psi_j| P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big].\n"
"\\end{split}\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"\\begin{split}\n"
"    \\Rightarrow\\quad\\langle X\\rangle &= \\frac{1}{4}\\Bigg(\\Big\\|| \\psi_j\\rangle + P|\\psi_i\\rangle \\Big\\|^2-\\Big\\||\\psi_j\\rangle - P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big\\|^2\\Bigg) \\\\\n"
"    &= \\text{Re}\\Big[\\langle\\psi_j| P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big].\n"
"\\end{split}\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"From the identity $|a + b\\|^2 = \\langle a + b | a + b \\rangle = \\|a\\|^2 + \\|b\\|^2 + 2\\text{Re}\\langle a | b \\rangle$. Similarly, measuring $Y$ yields\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    \\langle Y\\rangle = \\text{Im}\\Big[\\langle\\psi_j| P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big].\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Aus der Identität $|a + b\\|^2 = \\langle a + b | a + b \\rangle = \\|a\\|^2 + \\|b\\|^2 + 2\\text{Re}\\langle a | b \\rangle$. Ebenso ergibt die Messung von $Y$\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{equation*}\n"
"    \\langle Y\\rangle = \\text{Im}\\Big[\\langle\\psi_j| P|\\psi_i\\rangle\\Big].\n"
"\\end{equation*}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-"
"diagonalization/extracted-"
"outputs/7c1efca7-7db9-43a9-bcb7-053ba274d6f6-1.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-"
